      "narration": "In this video, we're going to talk about asthma, and what happens inside the airways. [pause] By the end of this video, you'll know exactly what asthma is. You'll know where in the airways it happens. You'll know what happens during an attack. And you'll know how reliever and preventer inhalers help."
