      "narration": "A common mistake sounds like this: I feel fine, so I stopped my preventer, and just use the reliever when I need it. But overreliance on the reliever, with the preventer skipped, is linked to poorer control and a higher risk of attacks. [pause] The preventer should be taken every day, even when feeling well, and inhaler technique should be checked regularly.",
